    "detailed_description": "Story<br />\r\nThe player lost in a Labyrinthine village in another world is looking for a way out alone.<br />\r\nYou explore the village from a first-person perspective and find the exit.<br />\r\nThere are many creatures lurking in the village. All of them are terrifying creatures you've never seen before.<br />\r\nWill you be able to leave the village safely?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSystem<br />\r\nThis game is a walking simulation game, and all you have to do is walk in the dark village.<br />\r\nThe controls for this game are easy, just grab your flashlight and keep walking and look for exit.<br />\r\nYou can have an experience like you're actually in a village of horror.",
